      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A major presenting complaint in dental practice is of sensitive teeth. In order to manage the problem well, a correct diagnosis is essential. Whilst it is true that 'common things occur commonly', one should consider all possible causes of pain in taking a history and examining the patient. This paper summarizes how to identify the potential causes of such a complaint."},
